{"channelId":"UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA","row":["Cincinnati Animal CARE Foster Team",48,"Cincinnati Animal CARE is committed to the safety, care, and protection of all animals in our community. Since our establishment in 2020, we have been a no kill organization that operates as Hamilton County's only animal shelter. \n\nThe Foster Department prioritizes animal's care and wellness by allowing them to spend the time they are in the shelter's care in a home. We are so lucky to have the community we do; a community that has helped us save thousands of lives through fostering!\n\nLearn more at cincinnatianimalcare.org/foster today!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:01.527Z","channelId":"UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d087ac2566208621333a16e9aa5f4029f10d2ec4ff3bad628f9d9c45f455d1e5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"66b1f748df1dc8bf40fde3e96e3df17012332cb16dd368c2635f088b8194fc75"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":48,"raw":"48 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:01.527Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClGwMBnBynIzvDKGqYgknyA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":" establishment in 2020, we have been a no kill o